OL,3,GNEWSARevamp plans for shipping
OL,4,Acontainer food venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to improve a York street food
OL,7,Fvenue housed in shipping containers
OL,8,Fhave been lodged.
OL,10,FAn application from SPARK:York to
OL,11,Freplace its existing stairs, relocate
OL,12,Fits lift and refurbish its entrance has
OL,13,Fbeen submitted to City of York Council.
OL,15,FPlans had been scaled back following
OL,16,Fconsultation with council officers,
OL,17,Fwith the proposed changes intended to
OL,18,Fmake the venue safer and easier for
OL,19,Feveryone to use.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
